DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
15721::$$$message_0122_0000_0000$$$::I'll go to Tohsaka's house.[lr]::
15722::$$$message_0122_0000_0001$$$::After coming back home, she told me to come to her house if I had the time, so I should drop by.::
15723::$$$message_0122_0001_0000$$$::And as I go inside the Tohsaka house...[lr]::
15724::$$$message_0122_0001_0001$$$::"...What are you doing?"[lr]::
15725::$$$message_0122_0001_0002$$$::"Oh, Shirou... Can't you tell by looking?"::
15726::$$$message_0122_0002_0000$$$::...It doesn't not...look like she's cooking.[lr]::
15727::$$$message_0122_0002_0001$$$::There is a rather vintage pot on her desk.[lr]::
15728::$$$message_0122_0002_0002$$$::Most of all, it looks rather worn out and weirdly shaped, so it doesn't look like an item that you'd cook with.[lr]::
15729::$$$message_0122_0002_0003$$$::On top of that, a mountain of ingredients are piled up.[lr]::
15730::$$$message_0122_0002_0004$$$::There's a bunch of peculiar vegetables that aren't commonly used.::
15731::$$$message_0122_0003_0000$$$::"...Tohsaka, are you going to eat that?"[lr]::
15732::$$$message_0122_0003_0001$$$::"You ask odd things. These are all medicinal herbs."::
15733::$$$message_0122_0004_0000$$$::...Oh, medicinal herbs. Then will it be edible?[lr]::
15734::$$$message_0122_0004_0001$$$::No, it might be medicine that you put on wounds.[lr]::
15735::$$$message_0122_0004_0002$$$::I've had Tohsaka put some secret ointment of the Tohsaka family on me before. So this is how it's made.::
15736::$$$message_0122_0005_0000$$$::"Oh... Yeah, I didn't say what I'm making. [cacheimage storage=凛私服04a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服04a(中) textoff=0]I'm going to make this into an infusion."[lr]::
15737::$$$message_0122_0005_0001$$$::"Hm? Will it be nourishing, or for rejuvenating beauty?"[lr]::
15738::$$$message_0122_0005_0002$$$::"I might be able to make it into my side job if I'm able to make it. It seems like there's actually a lot of businesses that are operating as drugstores on the surface."[lr]::
15739::$$$message_0122_0005_0003$$$::I see.[lr]::
15740::$$$message_0122_0005_0004$$$::So since the old days when mages, doctors, and faith healers couldn't be differentiated, the reputation of a drugstore was standard.[lr]::
15741::$$$message_0122_0005_0005$$$::...However. When Tohsaka says "side job," I feel this urgent sense of desperation.::
15742::$$$message_0122_0006_0000$$$::"Emiya. What are you smiling about?"[lr]::
15743::$$$message_0122_0006_0001$$$::"Nothing. So, what are you using that for?"[lr]::
15744::$$$message_0122_0006_0002$$$::"...It's something that you must not need, but I shall tell my unworthy pupil."[lr]::
15745::$$$message_0122_0006_0003$$$::I nod and listen to what Tohsaka has to say.::
15746::$$$message_0122_0007_0000$$$::"It's a medicine to suppress the Magic Crest."[lr]::
15747::$$$message_0122_0007_0001$$$::"...I see, I wouldn't need that."[lr]::
15748::$$$message_0122_0007_0002$$$::A Magic Crest.[lr]::
15749::$$$message_0122_0007_0003$$$::I don't have one, but it's a type of inheritance that Tohsaka has succeeded from her ancestors.[lr]::
15750::$$$message_0122_0007_0004$$$::It is the achievement and tenacity of a mage, a fixed mystery.[lr]::
15751::$$$message_0122_0007_0005$$$::That is fully engraved into Tohsaka's left arm.::
15752::$$$message_0122_0008_0000$$$::"The Magic Crest will get used to you once you grow up, but it's someone else's body in the end. It's hard to suppress it unless you take medicine after all."[lr]::
15753::$$$message_0122_0008_0001$$$::"Like an immunosuppressant..."[lr]::
15754::$$$message_0122_0008_0002$$$::"That is, unless you're a mage family with a lineage spanning 500 or 600 years. [cacheimage storage=凛私服01e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服01e(中) time=300 textoff=0]Mine has blood from outside the clan, and it's a lineage from the Far East of less than only 200 years, so we have to rely on these kinds of things."::
15755::$$$message_0122_0009_0000$$$::...Only 200 years.[lr]::
15756::$$$message_0122_0009_0001$$$::All this talk is making me dizzy.[lr]::
15757::$$$message_0122_0009_0002$$$::It's a large enough scale to make me sigh and impossible to imagine from the days that I admired Kiritsugu and wanted to become a mage like him.::
15758::$$$message_0122_0010_0000$$$::"Isn't being able to use things like this also proof that you're a distinguished mage?"[lr]::
15759::$$$message_0122_0010_0001$$$::"...Maybe. Well then, Shirou, please take this."[lr]::
15760::$$$message_0122_0010_0002$$$::Tohsaka smiles as she pushes an old book into my hands.[lr]::
15761::$$$message_0122_0010_0003$$$::It's as worn out as the pot...[lr]::
15762::$$$message_0122_0010_0004$$$::...Who? Naga...to... Tohsaka...::
15763::$$$message_0122_0011_0000$$$::"It says the instructions where the sticky note is, so I'll leave the rest to you."[lr]::
15764::$$$message_0122_0011_0001$$$::"Wait, Tohsaka. What is this?"[lr]::
15765::$$$message_0122_0011_0002$$$::"Huh? It's the formula book passed down from my ancestors. Since you're my pupil, I'll show you my family's important[line len=2]"[lr]::
15766::$$$message_0122_0011_0003$$$::"...Are you sure it's okay if I make it?"[lr]::
15767::$$$message_0122_0011_0004$$$::I ask Tohsaka, without concealing my worries.::
15768::$$$message_0122_0012_0000$$$::I mean, isn't that right? It's like administering an immunosuppressant that an amateur made to a heart transplant patient. There's a limit to how reckless you can be.[lr]::
15769::$$$message_0122_0012_0001$$$::Plus, Tohsaka is the one who is taking it.::
15770::$$$message_0122_0013_0000$$$::"If you make it as it says, it's fine. I was also trained against my will when I was an elementary schooler."[lr]::
15771::$$$message_0122_0013_0001$$$::"...So you're saying it's fine?"[lr]::
15772::$$$message_0122_0013_0002$$$::"This is part of your training, Emiya.[lr]::
15773::$$$message_0122_0013_0003$$$::Stop complaining and do it. I'll check the finished product."::
15774::$$$message_0122_0014_0000$$$::"...Mrgh."[lr]::
15775::$$$message_0122_0014_0001$$$::It can't be helped if she tells me that.[lr]::
15776::$$$message_0122_0014_0002$$$::I can't lose if she was trained when she was an elementary schooler.::
15777::$$$message_0122_0015_0000$$$::"Okay, I'll try then... Oof, it's handwritten. And it's in cursive..."[lr]::
15778::$$$message_0122_0015_0001$$$::I can't help but groan when I see the yellowed pages of the bound book.[lr]::
15779::$$$message_0122_0015_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05b(中) textoff=0][se storage=se522.wav]So Tohsaka's ancestor was from that kind of era. There's things written in with pen on top of the brush writing, and it's totally like a research journal passed down from generation to generation.::
15780::$$$message_0122_0016_0000$$$::"Yeah, I have to recompile it during my generation; it's starting to reach its limit."[lr]::
15781::$$$message_0122_0016_0001$$$::"...So, Tohsaka. It's this page, right?"[lr]::
15782::$$$message_0122_0016_0002$$$::I show Tohsaka the page that has the sticky note on it.[lr]::
15783::$$$message_0122_0016_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06e(中) textoff=0]I'm not sure what I'd do if it was a completely different page because of Tohsaka's famous carelessness again.[lr]::
15784::$$$message_0122_0016_0004$$$::Tohsaka frantically looks at it after I point it out...::
15785::$$$message_0122_0017_0000$$$::"...Yeah, that.[lr]::
15786::$$$message_0122_0017_0001$$$::I thought I made a mistake again."[lr]::
15787::$$$message_0122_0017_0002$$$::"Again...?"[lr]::
15788::$$$message_0122_0017_0003$$$::If I probe any further, I might push Tohsaka's buttons.[lr]::
15789::$$$message_0122_0017_0004$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から time=300 pos=all]I see off Tohsaka, who still seems like she's in a good mood. All right, I should start cooking... I mean, formulating.::
15790::$$$message_0122_0018_0000$$$::...Is she really gonna drink this?[lr]::
15791::$$$message_0122_0018_0001$$$::I peek into the witch's cauldron that's boiling in front of me.[lr]::
15792::$$$message_0122_0018_0002$$$::No, I can't peek. If I smell it, I feel like my lunch is going to come back up.::
15793::$$$message_0122_0019_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15794::$$$message_0122_0019_0001$$$::I timidly extend just my arm and mix it with a wooden spatula.[lr]::
15795::$$$message_0122_0019_0002$$$::It was wrong for me to think that I could just use a regular pot. It was also wrong for me to think that I could just boil it in the kitchen.[lr]::
15796::$$$message_0122_0019_0003$$$::I never want to cook using this pot or kitchen ever again after making this.::
15797::$$$message_0122_0020_0000$$$::"Is this thing even drinkable...?"[lr]::
15798::$$$message_0122_0020_0001$$$::I'll try taste testing just in case.[lr]::
15799::$$$message_0122_0020_0002$$$::Tohsaka is going to drink it too.[lr]::
15800::$$$message_0122_0020_0003$$$::...I think that being a mage is a rough job, having to drink something like this.::
15801::$$$message_0122_0021_0000$$$::"Come to think of it, Fuji-nee made me drink green juice. Compared to that..."[lr]::
15802::$$$message_0122_0021_0001$$$::I hypnotize myself and pinch my nose.[lr]::
15803::$$$message_0122_0021_0002$$$::I muster up my courage and lick it with my tongue.[lr]::
15804::$$$message_0122_0021_0003$$$::See, it's nothing compared to a cup of green juice or a plate full of mapo tofu from Taishan[line len=3]::
15805::$$$message_0122_0022_0000$$$::"BLEGHHHHHHHHH!"[rf][lr]::
15806::$$$message_0122_0022_0001$$$::"How noisy, what are you doing?"[lr]::
15807::$$$message_0122_0022_0002$$$::M-My tongue, or more like my entire mouth, is getting contaminated.[lr]::
15808::$$$message_0122_0022_0003$$$::I guess "contaminated" is going too far, no, I can only think this is a challenge towards my taste buds. No, not just me, but towards the entire human race!::
15809::$$$message_0122_0023_0000$$$::"Guh, [wvl canskip=0 time=500]ugh, [wvl canskip=0 time=300]y-[wvl canskip=0 time=200]yuck!"[lr]::
15810::$$$message_0122_0023_0001$$$::"Oh, the bad taste is a given. If medicine was yummy, it wouldn't seem like it works.[lr]::
15811::$$$message_0122_0023_0002$$$::[chgfg storage=凛私服04c(中) time=200 textoff=0]Don't you think that sugar-coated pills are blasphemy, Emiya?"[lr]::
15812::$$$message_0122_0023_0003$$$::"If you can enjoy drinking it, that's justice! Hey Tohsaka, anything that tastes this bad has got to count as harassment...!"[lr]::
15813::$$$message_0122_0023_0004$$$::"What? That's weird, it shouldn't be that bad... Did you mess up?"[lr]::
15814::$$$message_0122_0023_0005$$$::Tohsaka calmly checks that poisonous stew pot.::
15815::$$$message_0122_0024_0000$$$::"Oh, yep, well done."[lr]::
15816::$$$message_0122_0024_0001$$$::"...It's...well done? ...Hey. Are you really going to drink this?"[lr]::
15817::$$$message_0122_0024_0002$$$::I can't help but wish for a moment that it's a lie.[lr]::
15818::$$$message_0122_0024_0003$$$::"Huh? Of course, a whole glass.[lr]::
15819::$$$message_0122_0024_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03d(中) textoff=0]What's wrong? Why are you shaking in the corner? You're like a researcher that was attacked by an alien."::
15820::$$$message_0122_0025_0000$$$::"Hrrk..."[lr]::
15821::$$$message_0122_0025_0001$$$::Of course I would become the first pitiful victim. As someone that cooks, having a glass full of that palate-destroying liquid is equivalent to death.[lr]::
15822::$$$message_0122_0025_0002$$$::But... To a mage that has had brushes with death, a cup or two of nasty medicine should be nothing.[lr]::
15823::$$$message_0122_0025_0003$$$::...I'm reminded of the difference between my upbringing and Tohsaka's in a place like this.::
15824::$$$message_0122_0026_0000$$$::"Well... Yeah. I was wrong."[lr]::
15825::$$$message_0122_0026_0001$$$::Even in magecraft training, if I can be removed from death or danger from obstacles with this, then I should gladly drink it, too.::
15826::$$$message_0122_0027_0000$$$::"Huh? Well, that's fine. What a weirdo.[lr]::
15827::$$$message_0122_0027_0001$$$::Then, all you have to do is keep on boiling it at low heat... [cacheimage storage=凛私服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服02a(中) textoff=0]Here, come with me for a bit."[lr]::
15828::$$$message_0122_0027_0002$$$::"Mrgh, there's something else?"::
15829::$$$message_0122_0028_0000$$$::"Since we still have some time, I thought I'd have you show me your progress in magecraft."[lr]::
15830::$$$message_0122_0028_0001$$$::Tohsaka is my mentor, so it's natural that she's curious about her pupil.[lr]::
15831::$$$message_0122_0028_0002$$$::But, I finally recalled my magecraft the other day... [font italic=true]Wait... What?[font italic=false]::
15832::$$$message_0122_0029_0000$$$::"What's wrong? You look lost... [cacheimage storage=凛私服06d(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06d(中) textoff=0]Could it be..."[lr]::
15833::$$$message_0122_0029_0001$$$::Tohsaka is tilting her head, seeing my face.[lr]::
15834::$$$message_0122_0029_0002$$$::I frantically get rid of my anxiety that I felt for a moment.::
15835::$$$message_0122_0030_0000$$$::"Could it be that you were slacking off while I was gone..."[lr]::
15836::$$$message_0122_0030_0001$$$::"That's not true, well, I was putting in effort in my own way[line len=2]"[lr]::
15837::$$$message_0122_0030_0002$$$::"Oh, if that's the case, then why don't you show me?[lr]::
15838::$$$message_0122_0030_0003$$$::Now, prepare yourself and come into my room."::
15839::$$$message_0122_0031_0000$$$::"...Oof..."[lr]::
15840::$$$message_0122_0031_0001$$$::It can't be helped at this point... I can only be honest and show her how much I've improved in magecraft...::
15841::$$$message_0122_0032_0000$$$::The task is very simple.[lr]::
15842::$$$message_0122_0032_0001$$$::To Strengthen the plastic letter opener that she handed me.[lr]::
15843::$$$message_0122_0032_0002$$$::Tohsaka said that it's a teaching material that's fit for me.::
15844::$$$message_0122_0033_0000$$$::I activate my Strengthening while Tohsaka watches over me.[lr]::
15845::$$$message_0122_0033_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服02a(中) textoff=0]The usual words, triggering an illusion, concentrate...[lr]::
15846::$$$message_0122_0033_0002$$$::...Trace, on.::
15847::$$$message_0122_0034_0000$$$::I run magical energy through my Magic Circuits and awaken it.[lr]::
15848::$$$message_0122_0034_0001$$$::I analyze the material of the letter opener that I touched and grasp its structure. I run magical energy through that shape and existence, and I Strengthen it.[lr]::
15849::$$$message_0122_0034_0002$$$::It's something that I've gone through tens and hundreds of times.[lr]::
15850::$$$message_0122_0034_0003$$$::I erase my anxiety.[lr]::
15851::$$$message_0122_0034_0004$$$::With one sole purpose, I run my will through my own circuit.::
15852::$$$message_0122_0035_0000$$$::"...I did it."[lr]::
15853::$$$message_0122_0035_0001$$$::...Ahh.[lr]::
15854::$$$message_0122_0035_0002$$$::I avoided having to humiliate myself in front of Tohsaka and wipe off the trickling sweat from my forehead.::
15855::$$$message_0122_0036_0000$$$::"Hup[line len=3]"[lr]::
15856::$$$message_0122_0036_0001$$$::I try throwing it at the dartboard in the corner of the room.[lr]::
15857::$$$message_0122_0036_0002$$$::Even if it flies like a throwing knife, there's no way a letter opener made of plastic would stick.[lr]::
15858::$$$message_0122_0036_0003$$$::But now that it's hardened as much as steel, it should be able to stick [se storage=se341.wav]easily...::
15859::$$$message_0122_0037_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
15860::$$$message_0122_0037_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
15861::$$$message_0122_0037_0002$$$::Tohsaka is making a face like she can't watch any longer.[lr]::
15862::$$$message_0122_0037_0003$$$::The letter opener bounces off the dartboard and falls.[lr]::
15863::$$$message_0122_0037_0004$$$::...No, it should've succeeded. Could it be that the Strengthening was too weak?[lr]::
15864::$$$message_0122_0037_0005$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服08d(中) textoff=0]As Tohsaka picks up the letter opener that fell, she holds it up to examine it, puts it away, and gives me feedback.::
15865::$$$message_0122_0038_0000$$$::"...Haven't you gotten worse than before, Emiya?"[lr]::
15866::$$$message_0122_0038_0001$$$::"Tohsaka, I would've broken the letter opener if I messed up before. Compared to that, it's a lot more[line len=2]"[lr]::
15867::$$$message_0122_0038_0002$$$::"I don't care about how the way you messed up improved.[lr]::
15868::$$$message_0122_0038_0003$$$::[chgfg storage=凛私服08a(中) time=300 textoff=0]But it's somehow...strange..."[lr]::
15869::$$$message_0122_0038_0004$$$::She looks me up and down.[lr]::
15870::$$$message_0122_0038_0005$$$::Has Tohsaka noticed something? But, I can only hear sighs from Tohsaka.::
15871::$$$message_0122_0039_0000$$$::"Fine, it looks like I'll have to train you for a day or two again."[lr]::
15872::$$$message_0122_0039_0001$$$::"I'm ashamed..."[lr]::
15873::$$$message_0122_0039_0002$$$::"Try to become a proper mage with both honor and dignity. [cacheimage storage=凛私服12a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服12a(中) time=300 textoff=0]Even if I take you over there like this, you could humiliate not just yourself, but me as well."::
15874::$$$message_0122_0040_0000$$$::Studying magecraft with Tohsaka for a whole day.[lr]::
15875::$$$message_0122_0040_0001$$$::I'm free this weekend, and if she's saying she'll take the time for me, there's no other choice but to have her take me under her wing.[lr]::
15876::$$$message_0122_0040_0002$$$::I bow my head to Tohsaka, saying I'll owe her one.::
15877::$$$message_0122_0041_0000$$$::"Hmm... Ahh, I wonder where we should start. That's right, with that special medicine..."[lr]::
15878::$$$message_0122_0041_0001$$$::"...Does it taste worse than that decoction?"[lr]::
15879::$$$message_0122_0041_0002$$$::"Oh? If you're fine with using them, I have a collection full of variety."[lr]::
15880::$$$message_0122_0041_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05c(中) textoff=0]...I can't tell if she's joking or serious.[lr]::
15881::$$$message_0122_0041_0004$$$::...Well, if I can quickly make progress with that, the pain would be a small price to pay.::
15882::$$$message_0122_0042_0000$$$::"...Why are you making that face again, Shirou?"[lr]::
15883::$$$message_0122_0042_0001$$$::"All right. I just need to come to your place, right?"[lr]::
15884::$$$message_0122_0042_0002$$$::"Yeah, I'll train you thoroughly, so brace yourself."[lr]::
15885::$$$message_0122_0042_0003$$$::Now, we've made another promise.[lr]::
15886::$$$message_0122_0042_0004$$$::Although I'm not sure whether this will be good or bad.::
915805::$$$message_9122_0022_0000$$$::"BLEGHHHHHHHHH!"[r]:��